terns across various sectors can reveal the dependency of certain industries on this resource and potential vulnerabilities or opportunities."}],"related":[{"slug":"bank-credit-industry","title":"Bank Credit - Industry"},{"slug":"capacity-utilisation","title":"Capacity Utilisation"},{"slug":"cement-production","title":"Cement Production"},{"slug":"energy-requirements","title":"Energy Requirements"},{"slug":"exports-manufactured-goods","title":"Exports - Manufactured Goods"},{"slug":"hsbc-manufacturing-purchasing-managers-index-pmi","title":"HSBC Manufacturing PMI"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-consumer-durables","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- Consumer Durables"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-consumer-non-durables","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- Consumer Non-Durables"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-electricity","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- Electricity"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-manufacturing","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- Manufacturing"},{"slug":"index-of-industrial-production-iip-mining","title":"Index of Industrial Production (IIP)- Mining"},{"slug":"petroleum-consumption","title":"Petroleum Consumption"},{"slug":"steel-production","title":"Steel Production"},{"slug":"wholesale-price-index-wpi-inflation-manufacturing","title":"Wholesale Price Index (WPI) Inflation - Manufacturing"}],"title":"Natural Gas Production","description":"India's natural gas production stands at 2,729.7 Million cubic metres for Sep 2026. Domestic output relative to consumption affects reliance on imported LNG.","headline":{"Absolute":"India's natural gas production stands at 2,729.7 Million cubic metres for Sep 2026. Domestic output relative to consumption affects reliance on imported LNG.","Y-o-Y":"India's natural gas production stands at -4.55% for Sep 2026. Domestic output relative to consumption affects reliance on imported LNG."},"source":null,"source_url":nu